@startuml agent-multi
title agent-multi: 4B executor + 4 big-model peers (spec 001-agent-multi-llm-fleet)

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam ActorStyle awesome

actor "Human\nspectator" as Human

rectangle "Game Engine (GoK build)" as Engine {
  component "AI-Play layer\nsrc/AIPlay/" as AIPlay
}

component "MCP sidecar\n:8302/mcp\n(aiplay_mcp.py)" as Sidecar

rectangle "tools/agent-multi.py\n(one process, 5 loops)" as Multi {

  component "COMMANDER (executor)\n4B: 192.168.1.106:9931\nEXECUTOR_PROMPT:\n 1 builds in progress\n 2 no idle ships\n 3 research in progress" as CC
  component "STRATEGIST\npeer :9931\nplan/research/attack" as PS
  component "ANALYST\npeer :9932\nbattle-event reactions" as PA
  component "ECONOMIST\npeer :9933\nproduction plan" as PE
  component "CRITIC\npeer :9934\norders objections" as PC
}

database "/tmp/aiplay-multi-<id>/" as Store {
  file "strategist.json" as A1
  file "economist.json" as A2
  file "analyst.json" as A3
  file "critic.json" as A4
  file "orders.json\n(last 20 orders)" as A5
}

cloud "Big LLM servers\n192.168.2.72:9931-9934\n(cache-reuse + swa-full)" as LLMs
cloud "4B executor\n192.168.1.106:9931" as L0

Human --> CC : watches game window\n(Caps Lock overlay)

' commander round pipeline
CC --> Sidecar : observe (snapshot)\n+ get_events + save_game
Sidecar --> AIPlay : UDS /tmp/homeworld-aiplay.sock
AIPlay --> CC : snapshot (tick/fleet/buildQueue/\nresearch/techTree/dps-range) + events + autosave events

CC --> L0 : round prompt =\nEXECUTOR_PROMPT + peer merge\n+ snapshot + nags
L0 --> CC : 1 tool call\n(order_*/save_game)
CC --> Sidecar : order_*</save_game>\n(sole binder+orderer)

CC --> A5 : append order ring
CC --> Store : read peer artifacts\n(freshness <= 60s, zero LLM cost)

PS --> A1 : publish artifact (atomic replace)
PE --> A2 : publish production plan
PA --> A3 : publish reactions
PC --> A4 : publish objections
A5 --> PC : recent orders
A1 --> PC : plan to review
A1 --> CC : directives
A2 --> CC : production plan
A3 --> CC : threat reactions
A4 --> CC : objections (advisory)

PS --> LLMs : chat (no tools array)\nfull snapshot, rolling ctx
PA --> LLMs : chat (compressed view + events)
PE --> LLMs : chat (full snapshot + techTree)
PC --> LLMs : chat (orders + peer artifacts)

note right of Multi
  Reset rebase: tick decreases -> all loops
  clear context (FR-007). Match over ->
  peers idle with summary (30s poll).
  Peer errors -> backoff 1s..30s, never
  blocks the commander (US1).
end note
@enduml